Output docs/demo.gif
Output docs/demo.mp4

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1600
Set Height 980
Set Padding 0
Set Framerate 24
Set TypingSpeed 0
Set Theme { "background": "#0b0b14", "foreground": "#e2e2ec" }

Hide
Type "export PATH=$HOME/.cargo/bin:$PATH; clear; ccwolf --demo --lang fr --speed 1.4" Enter
Sleep 1s
Show
Sleep 3s
Enter
Sleep 60s
